* Behavioral CD4046B model for LTspice (FM decoder PLL)
* Logic runs on VDD..VSS. Only the pins used by the decoder are modelled:
* SIGIN self-biased squarer, COMPIN, PC1 (XOR), VCO.
* VCO frequency: fmin at VCOIN = VSS, fmax at VCOIN = VDD (set on the real chip by R1, R2, C1)
.subckt CD4046 SIGIN COMPIN PC1OUT VCOIN VCOOUT VDD VSS params: fmin=68k fmax=84k
Rbias SIGIN mid 220k
Bmid mid VSS V=V(VDD,VSS)/2
Ba a VSS V=0.5+0.5*tanh(300*(V(SIGIN)-V(mid)))
Bb b VSS V=0.5+0.5*tanh(20*(V(COMPIN)-V(mid)))
Bpc PC1OUT VSS V=V(VDD,VSS)*(V(a,VSS)+V(b,VSS)-2*V(a,VSS)*V(b,VSS))
Bth VSS th I=u(time-1n)*(fmin+(fmax-fmin)*min(max(V(VCOIN,VSS)/V(VDD,VSS),0),1))
Cth th VSS 1
Rth th VSS 1e12
Bvco VCOOUT VSS V=V(VDD,VSS)*(0.5+0.5*tanh(40*sin(2*pi*V(th,VSS))))
.ends CD4046
